 "notes": [
  "Characters header says (22) but lists 23; Weapons header says (4) but lists 3 (Force Pike x2, Vader's Lightsaber); total 60 as published.",
  "The strategy calls Imperial Arrest Order, Mobilization Points and There Is No Try & Oppressive Enforcement 'Starting effect' (Something Special Planned For Them instead of TiNT/OE in one matchup); Prepared Defenses is listed but not called a starting card, so starting.interrupt is left empty. Several Effects start, so no single starting Effect is set.",
  "Resistance is the Jabba's Palace Effect (not the Reflections III shield). Forest, Jungle, Spaceport Docking Bay and Spaceport Prefect's Office are the generic Special Edition sites used as Ralltiir sites.",
  "The post says the author 'brought it to a tourney' (unnamed), lost one game by 29, 'But I finished 2nd on the day (runner up to Steve Brentson...)'; no event named, so filed as general.",
  "The update at the top of the post corrects a rules point in the strategy (Squadrons and Sienar Fleet Systems); the list is unchanged."
 ],
